{"strongs": "H2934", "word": "טָמַן", "translit": "ta.man", "root": "טלם", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "hide, conceal", "definition": "טָמַן verb hide, conceal , especially in earth (Late Hebrew id. ; whence perhaps Aramaic טְמֵן keep, preserve ; compare Arabic bury, hide (loan-word Frä 137 ); Aramaic , טְמַר id. ); — Qal Perfect טְמֵן Ps 35:8 + 2 t. etc; Imperfect וַיִּטְמֹן Gen 35:4 , etc.; Imperative suffix טָמְנֵהוּ Jer 13:4 טָמְנֵם Job 40:13 Infinitive construct לִטְמוֺן Job 31:33 ; Ps 64:6 Passive participle טָמוּן Job 3:16 + 3 t.; טְמוּנָה Josh 7:22 plural טְמֻנִים Josh 7:21 construct טְמוּנֵי Deut 33:19 — 1. hide , with accusative Gen 35:4 ( E ), Exod 2:12 ( E ; dead body in sand), Josh 2:6 ( J E ; spies under flax-stalks), Josh 7:21 ; Josh 7:22 ( J E ; Achan's theft), Jer 13:4 ; Jer 13:5 ; Jer 13:6 ; Jer 13:7 (Jeremiah's girdle), Jer 43:9 ; Jer 43:10 (stones at Tahpanhes); hide, bury hand in dish ( צַלָּ֑חַת ) Prov 19:24 ; Prov 26:15 (of עָצֵל the sluggard); נֵפֶל טָמוּן Job 3:16 hidden abortion , i.e. a lifeless child at once buried; שְׂפֻנֵי טְמוּנֵי חול Deut 33:19 (poem); of hiding iniquity עון Job 31:33 hiding the wicked in the dust עפר Job 40:13 . 2. often of hiding, concealing, secretly laying a snare רֶשֶׁת Ps 9:16 ; Ps 35:8 , followed by לִי Ps 31:5 שַׁחַת רִשְׁתָּם Ps 35:7 פַּח followed by לִי Ps 140:6 ; Ps 142:4 followed by לרגלי Jer 18:22 חבל Job 18:10 מוֺקשׁים Ps 64:5 . 3. טָמוּן that which is darkened = darkness , Job 40:13 nearly = ׃שְׁאוֺל ׳ פניהם חֲבשׁ בט bind their faces in darkness (i.e. the wicked); hide = reserve Job 20:26 all darkness is held in reserve for his treasures , i.e. all calamities are stored up for them. Niph`al Imperative חִטָּמֵן בֶּעָפָר ׳ מִפְּנֵי פַּחַד י Isa 2:10 hide thyself in the dust, from before the terror of ׳ י . Hiph`il (or Qal ? Ba ZMG 1889, 180 ) Imperfect וַיֵּלִכוּ וַיַּטְמִנוּ 2Kgs 7:8 (twice in verse) and they went and hid (it), i.e. plunder from Aramaic camp.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3351')\">BDB3351</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2934')\">H2934</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3350')\">BDB3350</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3352')\">BDB3352</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>טָמַן</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>hide, conceal</highlightword>, especially in <highlight>earth</highlight> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; whence perhaps Aramaic <bdbarc>טְמֵן</bdbarc> <highlight>keep, preserve</highlight>; compare Arabic <placeholder2120/> <highlight>bury, hide</highlight> (loan-word <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Frä')\">Frä<sup>137</sup></lookup>); Aramaic <placeholder2121/>, <bdbheb>טְמַר</bdbheb> <highlight>id.</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>טְמֵן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 35:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,8)\">Ps 35:8</ref> + 2 t. etc; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיִּטְמֹן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 35:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,4)\">Gen 35:4</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>טָמְנֵהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 13:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,4)\">Jer 13:4</ref> <bdbheb>טָמְנֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 40:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,13)\">Job 40:13</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לִטְמוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 31:33\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,33)\">Job 31:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 64:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,64,6)\">Ps 64:6</ref> <highlight>Passive participle</highlight> <bdbheb>טָמוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,16)\">Job 3:16</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>טְמוּנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 7:22\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,22)\">Josh 7:22</ref> plural <bdbheb>טְמֻנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 7:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,21)\">Josh 7:21</ref> construct <bdbheb>טְמוּנֵי</bdbheb><ref ref=\"Deut 33:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,19)\">Deut 33:19</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>hide</highlight>, with accusative <ref ref=\"Gen 35:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,4)\">Gen 35:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 2:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,2,12)\">Exod 2:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; dead body in sand), <ref ref=\"Josh 2:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,2,6)\">Josh 2:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; spies under flax-stalks), <ref ref=\"Josh 7:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,21)\">Josh 7:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 7:22\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,22)\">Josh 7:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; Achan's theft), <ref ref=\"Jer 13:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,4)\">Jer 13:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,5)\">Jer 13:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,6)\">Jer 13:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,7)\">Jer 13:7</ref> (Jeremiah's girdle), <ref ref=\"Jer 43:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,43,9)\">Jer 43:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 43:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,43,10)\">Jer 43:10</ref> (stones at Tahpanhes); <highlight>hide, bury</highlight> hand in dish (<bdbheb>צַלָּ֑חַת</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Prov 19:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,19,24)\">Prov 19:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 26:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,15)\">Prov 26:15</ref> (of <bdbheb>עָצֵל</bdbheb> the sluggard); <bdbheb>נֵפֶל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>טָמוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,16)\">Job 3:16</ref> <highlight>hidden abortion</highlight>, i.e. a lifeless child at once buried; <bdbheb>שְׂפֻנֵי טְמוּנֵי חול</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,19)\">Deut 33:19</ref> (poem); of hiding iniquity <bdbheb>עון</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 31:33\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,33)\">Job 31:33</ref> hiding the wicked in the dust <bdbheb>עפר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 40:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,13)\">Job 40:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> often of <highlight>hiding, concealing, secretly laying</highlight> a snare <bdbheb>רֶשֶׁת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 9:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,9,16)\">Ps 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,8)\">Ps 35:8</ref>, followed by <bdbheb>לִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 31:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,5)\">Ps 31:5</ref> <bdbheb>שַׁחַת רִשְׁתָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 35:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,7)\">Ps 35:7</ref> <bdbheb>פַּח</bdbheb> followed by <bdbheb>לִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 140:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"140\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"140\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,140,6)\">Ps 140:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 142:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"142\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"142\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,142,4)\">Ps 142:4</ref> followed by <bdbheb>לרגלי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 18:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,22)\">Jer 18:22</ref> <bdbheb>חבל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 18:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,18,10)\">Job 18:10</ref> <bdbheb>מוֺקשׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 64:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,64,5)\">Ps 64:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>טָמוּן</bdbheb> <highlight>that which is darkened</highlight> = <highlight>darkness</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Job 40:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,13)\">Job 40:13</ref> nearly = <bdbheb>׃שְׁאוֺל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פניהם חֲבשׁ בט</bdbheb> <highlight>bind their faces in darkness</highlight> (i.e. the wicked); <highlight>hide</highlight> = <highlight>reserve</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 20:26\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,26)\">Job 20:26</ref> <highlight>all darkness is held in reserve for his treasures</highlight>, i.e. all calamities are stored up for them. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>חִטָּמֵן בֶּעָפָר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִפְּנֵי פַּחַד י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 2:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,10)\">Isa 2:10</ref> <highlight>hide thyself in the dust, from before the terror of</highlight> <bdbheb>׳